{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-28-44", "n": 0, "text": "The rook on c8 dances forward to c6 with 22...Rc6. The rook on b7 is already eyeing the pawn on g7! And after 22...Rc6, nothing is there to defend that pawn on g7. White's rook on b7 leaps to g7 with 23.Rxg7, taking that pawn. Black could have let the pawn on g7 march forward to g6 instead of playing 22...Rc6.", "sentences": 4, "fallback_sentences": 0, "calls": 4, "seconds": 0.623, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-40-16", "n": 0, "text": "The rook on a8 slides sideways to c8 with 8...Rc8. The pawn on d4 is already eyeing the pawn on c5, and the rook on h8 stays snuggled away, locked by the pawn on h7 and the knight on g8 even after 8...Rc8. White's pawn on d4 marches forward to take the pawn on c5 with 9.dxc5! Black could have sent the knight on g8 to f6 with 8...Nf6, freeing the rook on h8.", "sentences": 4, "fallback_sentences": 0, "calls": 4, "seconds": 0.695, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-40-16", "n": 0, "text": "The rook on a8 makes a sideways stroll to c8 with 8...Rc8. The d4 pawn already targets the c5 pawn, and 8...Rc8 doesn't free the rook on h8 from the pawns on h7 and g8! 9.dxc5, White's pawn on d4 marches in and snags the pawn on c5. Black might have steered the party with 8...Nf6 instead of 8...Rc8, letting the knight on g8 advance to f6 and freeing the rook on h8.", "sentences": 4, "fallback_sentences": 0, "calls": 5, "seconds": 0.851, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-40-16", "n": 0, "text": "8...Rc8, the rook on a8 strolls sideways to c8! Even though White's pawn on d4 is already pointing a finger at Black's pawn on c5, the rook on h8 remains stuck, held tight by the pawns on h7 and the knight on g8 before 8...Rc8, and 8...Rc8 just doesn't give it freedom. White's pawn on d4 advances with 9.dxc5 and captures the pawn on c5. Black could have brought the knight from g8 to f6 with 8...Nf6 instead of 8...Rc8, freeing the rook on h8.", "sentences": 4, "fallback_sentences": 0, "calls": 4, "seconds": 0.832, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-40-16", "n": 0, "text": "The rook on a8 wanders sideways with 8...Rc8. The pawn on d4 is already sniffing at the pawn on c5, and even after 8...Rc8, the rook on h8 remains trapped by the pawn on h7 and the knight on g8! 9.dxc5, White's pawn on d4 hunts down the pawn on c5. Black's knight on g8 could have leaped to f6 with 8...Nf6, and that opens the road for the rook on h8.", "sentences": 4, "fallback_sentences": 0, "calls": 5, "seconds": 0.806, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-40-25", "n": 0, "text": "The bishop from c1 dances forth with 13.Bg5, and look at it attack the knight on f6! Black's rook on c8 slides its sidestep to d8 with 13...Rd8.", "sentences": 2, "fallback_sentences": 0, "calls": 2, "seconds": 0.308, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-40-28", "n": 0, "text": "The queen on e7 dances to f6 with 14...Qxf6, and that queen on f6 now eyeballs the knight on c3! The knight on c3 already has its sights set on the pawn on d5. With 15.Nxd5, White's knight on c3 makes a grab for the pawn on d5. That knight on d5 then sends a volley straight at the queen on f6. Black's pawn on g7 could have stomped the bishop on f6 with 14...gxf6 instead of 14...Qxf6.", "sentences": 4, "fallback_sentences": 0, "calls": 4, "seconds": 0.765, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-40-30", "n": 0, "text": "The queen on f6 slithers sideways to h6 with 15...Qh6, and look, the queen on h6 now eyes the bishop on h3! The king on g1 steps up to g2 with 16.Kg2, and this king on g2 keeps the bishop on h3 company. Black could have snuck in 15...Bxf2+ instead of 15...Qh6, where the bishop on c5 takes the pawn on f2, giving the king on g1 a sudden jolt of check.", "sentences": 3, "fallback_sentences": 0, "calls": 3, "seconds": 0.709, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
