{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-40-33", "n": 0, "text": "17.Qc1: the queen on d1 goes sideways from d1 to c1. The queen on c1 attacks the bishop on c5. The queen on c1 attacks the queen on h6. 17...exd5: Black's pawn from e6 chomps down on the knight on d5!", "sentences": 2, "fallback_sentences": 1, "calls": 4, "seconds": 0.756, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-40-34", "n": 0, "text": "The pawn on e6 lunges out with 17...exd5, taking the knight on d5! 18.Qxc5 sends White's queen on c1 to seize the bishop on c5. And now the queen on c5 stares down the knight on c6.", "sentences": 2, "fallback_sentences": 0, "calls": 2, "seconds": 0.379, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
{"arm": "default", "set": "heldout", "test": "lasker_chess_strategy-40-39", "n": 0, "text": "The queen on b5 retreats to d3 with 20.Qd3, and that queen on d3 now eyeballs the queen on d2 and the knight on d4! Black's queen on d2 points a stern finger right at White's queen on d3. Black's queen on d2 swigs in with 20...Qxd3, capturing the queen on d3, which was the defender of the knight on d4. 20.Qa4 instead would bring the queen from b5 to a4, where it eyes the knight on d4.", "sentences": 4, "fallback_sentences": 0, "calls": 4, "seconds": 0.757, "meta": {"commit": "a519c9307e06ce66162d8cafe4b09488899149bb", "dirty": false, "positions_sha256": "36f722fb226e992904505fc6c53b709b6b1b9c7d566b9d1f01956a7e9d3341a3", "config_sha256": "a5b39f19d1f47550aff340bcf2bb8f83fca556667e7d00692c19610fca52cc03", "board_lines_sha256": "7afc00bf282719db9f973ac9ee74f0c14dfa004b4ddc8df4b67d8127c0506ef3", "think": false, "num_ctx": 4096, "model": "scan64-bench-gemma4-e4b-q4ks:latest", "model_digest": "d6b577f31405977a6343b5bb1ab12122ff00b5c5cd99267e0112eedf85757a02", "ollama_version": "0.40.18", "size_vram": 3051733647}}
